cted</td><td class=\"num\">21 wrong + 28 pairs rejected, 8 equivalent accepted</td><td class=\"mono\">docs/FUZZ.json</td></tr><tr><td class=\"st\">a gate that exits 0 without its artefact is not a pass</td><td>a consumer that finishes with no evidence and is reported PASS</td><td class=\"num\">4 chain consumers as declared</td><td class=\"mono\">docs/CHAIN.json</td></tr><tr><td class=\"st\">a service is up only if every endpoint answers</td><td>a front door answering while its engine is dead</td><td class=\"num\">decision service 2/2, runtime 1/1</td><td class=\"mono\">tools/audit_services.py</td></tr><tr><td class=\"st\">the delivered pages render, execute and do not collide</td><td>a page error, a canvas never drawn, text overlap, contrast below AA</td><td class=\"num\">9 checks: build, currency, structure, layout, contrast, runtime, invariants</td><td class=\"mono\">tools/audit_site.py</td></tr><tr><td class=\"st\">chains run end to end against live boundaries</td><td>a chain that passes while its boundary is detached</td><td class=\"num\">10 pass, 1 skip, 0 fail</td><td class=\"mono\">docs/SELF_AUDIT.json</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\r\n   <p class=\"gm-sum\">10 chains pass,\r\n   1365 tests collected, 0 open defect(s)\r\n-  &middot; recorded 2026-11-04T10:14</p>\r\n+  &middot; recorded 2026-11-04T11:34</p>\r\n </div>\r\n <div class=\"grid2\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">\r\n   <div class=\"card\"><h3>Evolution: the defects its instruments caught</h3>\r\n     <p>Feature counts grow on their own. What matters is whether the framework can find its own\r\n     regressions: a mutation the gate accepts, a component with no style rule, a page that renders\r\n     without running, a service whose front door answers while its engine is dead.</p>\r\n     <div class=\"readout\">\r\n-      <div class=\"kv\"><div class=\"k\">mutation runs</div><div class=\"v\">2</div></div>\r\n+      <div class=\"kv\"><div class=\"k\">mutation runs</div><div class=\"v\">6</div></div>\r\n   